Looking at this problem, I need to find the number of colorings of 2022 signs (each R or B) such that every binary sequence of length 1011 appears as a subsequence.

Let me denote $k = 1011$, so we have a string $s$ of length $2k$ and need every binary string of length $k$ to be a subsequence.

